{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, then approach it. If approached, take object. Otherwise, move to object location, check properties, and perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
